    "en": {
      "title": "ChatGPT Pro $100 Is Really 2.6x Plus, Not 5x",
      "titleCore": "ChatGPT Pro $100 promises 5x Plus for Codex. We measured 2.6x",
      "description": "We priced 6 full Codex weekly windows on ChatGPT Pro $100 from our own logs. Median $175 of API value, 2.6x a $67 Plus week, not 5x. Data and CSV inside.",
      "body": "<p>OpenAI sells ChatGPT Pro $100 as <strong>5x the Codex usage of Plus</strong>. We drained 6 full Pro $100 weekly windows between September 27 and October 8, 2026, and priced every one of them from Codex's own logs. The median window held <strong>$175 of API-priced Codex</strong>. A Plus week holds about $67. That is <strong>2.6x</strong>, roughly half of what the label says.</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Label:</strong> 5x Plus, about $335 of API value a week.</li>\n<li><strong>Measured:</strong> $100 to $234 per full window, median $175.</li>\n<li><strong>Best window:</strong> 3.5x. <strong>Worst:</strong> 1.5x. Not one window reached 4x.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:30px 0 34px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 360\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"a1-t\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit\"><title id=\"a1-t\">API value of each full Pro $100 weekly window, normalized to 100% used</title><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"302.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"302.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"306.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$0</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"236.5\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"236.5\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"240.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$100</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"171.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"171.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"175.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$200</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"105.5\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"105.5\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"109.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$300</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">$400</text><rect x=\"81.7\" y=\"172.5\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"129.5\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"117.0\" y=\"166.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$198</text><text x=\"117.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 27 a</text><rect x=\"195.7\" y=\"197.6\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"104.4\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"231.0\" y=\"191.6\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$159</text><text x=\"231.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 27 b</text><rect x=\"309.7\" y=\"189.2\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"112.8\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"183.2\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$172</text><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 28</text><rect x=\"423.7\" y=\"236.6\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"65.4\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"459.0\" y=\"230.6\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$100</text><text x=\"459.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 30</text><rect x=\"537.7\" y=\"184.9\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"117.1\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"573.0\" y=\"178.9\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$179</text><text x=\"573.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 2</text><rect x=\"651.7\" y=\"148.4\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"153.6\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"687.0\" y=\"142.4\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">$234</text><text x=\"687.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 7</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"82.6\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"82.6\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"738.0\" y=\"76.6\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E8895C\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">5x Plus label: $335</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"187.1\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"187.1\" stroke=\"#E6EAF2\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"66.0\" y=\"181.1\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">Measured median: $175</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"258.1\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"258.1\" stroke=\"#7F8BA0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"738.0\" y=\"252.1\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">Plus week: $67</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7F8BA0;margin-top:8px\">API value of each full Pro $100 weekly window, normalized to 100% used</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>The math</h2>\n\n<p>The unit we use is API-equivalent dollars: every request's input, cached input and output tokens, priced at OpenAI's API list price for the model that served it. Plus is the baseline. Across 27 Plus weekly windows since August, a full Plus week priced at a median $67 (the full series is on <a href=\"/research/codex-usage-limits-chatgpt-pro\">our Codex usage limits page</a>).</p>\n\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th></th><th>API value per week</th><th>Multiple of Plus</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Plus ($20)</td><td>$67</td><td>1.0x</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pro $100, as advertised</td><td>$335</td><td>5.0x</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pro $100, measured median</td><td>$175</td><td>2.6x</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pro $200 after Oct 30, at the label (10x)</td><td>$670</td><td>10x</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Pro $200 after Oct 30, at our measured ratio</td><td>about $351</td><td>about 5.2x</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Per dollar of monthly price, a Plus week holds $3.35 of Codex. A Pro $100 week at our measured median holds $1.75. You pay 5x for 2.6x: the upgrade buys throughput, not a better unit price.</p>\n\n<figure style=\"margin:30px 0 34px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 360\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"a2-t\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit\"><title id=\"a2-t\">Each Pro $100 window as a multiple of a $67 Plus week</title><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"302.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"302.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"306.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">0x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"258.3\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"258.3\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"262.3\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">1x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"214.7\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"214.7\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"218.7\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">2x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"171.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"171.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"175.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">3x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"127.3\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"127.3\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"131.3\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">4x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"83.7\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"83.7\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"87.7\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">5x</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1E2A3F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"400\">6x</text><rect x=\"81.7\" y=\"173.1\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"128.9\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"117.0\" y=\"167.1\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">3.0x</text><text x=\"117.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 27 a</text><rect x=\"195.7\" y=\"198.1\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"103.9\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"231.0\" y=\"192.1\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">2.4x</text><text x=\"231.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 27 b</text><rect x=\"309.7\" y=\"189.8\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"112.2\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"183.8\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">2.6x</text><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 28</text><rect x=\"423.7\" y=\"237.0\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"65.0\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"459.0\" y=\"231.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">1.5x</text><text x=\"459.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Sep 30</text><rect x=\"537.7\" y=\"185.5\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"116.5\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"573.0\" y=\"179.5\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">2.7x</text><text x=\"573.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 2</text><rect x=\"651.7\" y=\"149.2\" width=\"70.7\" height=\"152.8\" fill=\"#E8895C\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"687.0\" y=\"143.2\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E6EAF2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">3.5x</text><text x=\"687.0\" y=\"320.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7F8BA0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Oct 7</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"83.7\" x2=\"744\" y2=\"83.7\" stroke=\"#E8895C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"738.0\" y=\"77.7\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E8895C\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">Advertised: 5x</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7F8BA0;margin-top:8px\">Each Pro $100 window as a multiple of a $67 Plus week</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Why the gap?</h2>\n\n<p>Three things could explain it, and we cannot fully separate them from the outside.</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The gauge does not track API prices.</strong> OpenAI meters Codex in its own units. If a cheap model like Luna draws on the gauge at a higher rate than its API price, dollars understate the quota used. Luna was 49% of our tokens but only 8% of the dollars.</li>\n<li><strong>Heavier sessions.</strong> Our Pro windows ran longer, more cache-heavy agent loops than our Plus weeks. Window 4 (Sep 30) was the cheapest at $100, almost entirely long GPT-6 Sol sessions.</li>\n<li><strong>The label is a ceiling, not a promise.</strong> OpenAI describes limits as approximate and dependent on task size. Others see the same ratio: one forum user who moved up from Pro $100 reported <a href=\"https://community.openai.com/t/pro-200-appears-to-be-giving-me-roughly-half-the-effective-codex-usage-i-had-on-pro-100/1403104\">roughly half the effective usage</a> they expected.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Measure your own multiplier in five minutes</h2>\n\n<p>Codex writes a JSONL log of every session under <code>~/.codex/sessions/</code>. Each request records cumulative input, cached input and output tokens, plus the weekly gauge (<code>used_percent</code>) and its <code>resets_at</code> time. We priced every request's token delta at the API list price of the model it ran on and grouped requests by weekly window. Dollar figures are API-equivalent value, not money we paid.</p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>Pick a weekly window you used to 100%.</li>\n<li>Sum the API value of every request inside it. That is your dollars per full window.</li>\n<li>Do the same for a Plus week, or use our $67.</li>\n<li>Divide. If your gauge stopped at, say, 80%, divide the dollars by 0.8 first.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>The raw numbers for all eight of our Pro $100 windows are in <a href=\"/assets/data/codex-pro-100-windows.csv\" download>codex-pro-100-windows.csv</a>: start, end, hours, percent used, API value, value per full window and multiple of Plus.</p>\n\n<h2>Is Pro $100 still worth it?</h2>\n\n<p>For heavy Codex users, yes, but because of resets more than the multiplier. In 12 days we got eight windows instead of two, and <a href=\"/research/codex-resets-value-12-days\">the resets were worth about 4x the plan itself</a>. On the multiplier alone, Pro $100 is 2.6x Plus for 5x the price. And from October 30, <a href=\"/research/chatgpt-pro-200-codex-cut-10x\">Pro $200 drops to 10x</a>, which at our measured ratio is about $351 a week.</p>\n\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/pricing\">OpenAI: Codex plans and usage limits</a></li><li><a href=\"https://venturebeat.com/orchestration/openai-introduces-chatgpt-pro-usd100-tier-with-5x-usage-limits-for-codex\">VentureBeat: ChatGPT Pro $100 tier with 5x Codex limits</a></li><li><a href=\"https://community.openai.com/t/pro-200-appears-to-be-giving-me-roughly-half-the-effective-codex-usage-i-had-on-pro-100/1403104\">OpenAI Community: Pro $200 giving roughly half the effective usage of Pro $100</a></li><li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing\">OpenAI API pricing</a></li></ul>",
      "faq": [
        {
          "question": "Is ChatGPT Pro $100 really 5x Plus for Codex?",
          "answer": "Not in our logs. Six full Pro $100 weekly windows priced at a median $175 of API-equivalent Codex usage, versus $67 for a Plus week. That is 2.6x, not 5x."
        },
        {
          "question": "How much Codex does a ChatGPT Pro $100 week include?",
          "answer": "Between $100 and $234 of API-priced usage per full weekly window in our measurements, median $175."
        },
        {
          "question": "How do I calculate my own Codex plan multiplier?",
          "answer": "Sum the API value of every request in a weekly window you used to 100%, using the token counts in ~/.codex/sessions, and divide by the value of a full Plus week."
        },
        {
          "question": "What will ChatGPT Pro $200 give after October 30?",
          "answer": "OpenAI says 10x Plus. If it scales like our measured Pro $100, that is about $351 of API value a week instead of $670."
        }
